---
layout: null
# Rendered from _data/macos_release.json, which the release flow
# (taigikeyboard's macos/scripts/publish-release.sh) is the only writer of.
#
# One published fact, one committed file. This used to be a second literal JSON
# file the release flow wrote in its own commit, and two commits seconds apart
# raced: each Pages run deploys the tree of its own commit, so on 2026-08-28 the
# run for the earlier commit finished last and served an appcast one release
# behind for a day. Deriving it here means a release touches one file, which
# leaves nothing to race.
#
# Contract for these fields lives in taigikeyboard's macos/updates/README.md;
# the readers are UpdateChecker.swift and UpdateInstallation.swift. `jsonify`
# rather than bare quotes so a value that ever needs escaping is escaped.
---
{
  "version": {{ site.data.macos_release.version | jsonify }},
  "downloadPageURL": {{ site.data.macos_release.releasePageURL | jsonify }},
  "packageURL": {{ site.data.macos_release.downloadURL | jsonify }}
}
